/* =====================================================================
   Torrent 2000 -- "CCCP" skin, HIGH-CONTRAST DARK variant (v3 rebuild)

   Matches the real Windows "High Contrast Black" accessibility contract --
   pure black background, pure white text/borders, a single universal
   yellow for focus/selection/accent, zero reliance on hue alone to carry
   meaning -- while keeping this theme's sharp square corners, bold Arial,
   and (new in this rebuild) the same 1px/2px/4px hairline/emphasis/bold
   border-weight tiers cccp.qss derives from the measured posters, so a
   dark_hc user gets the same structural rhythm, just recolored to the
   fixed HC palette below. This isn't a poster-measurement exercise like
   cccp.qss/cccp_dark.qss: the accessibility contract dictates the palette
   outright, and the yellow slot is the SAME one already fixed for every
   theme's dark_hc title bar (theme_manager.py's title_bar_style_for,
   minmax_hover_color/close_hover_color -> #FFFF00), so this variant is
   reused as an anchor rather than re-derived.

   TOKENS (hex, named)
   ------------------------------------------------------------------
     bg               #000000   pure black, everywhere -- HC does not
                                 distinguish surfaces by shade, only by the
                                 white borders between them
     surface          #000000   panels/cards are the same flat black; depth
                                 comes from borders, not tinting
     border           #FFFFFF   pure white
     text             #FFFFFF   pure white
     text-muted       #FFFFFF   HC has no "dimmer" text tier -- disabled is
                                 the only state allowed to read differently
     accent / focus   #FFFF00   universal yellow -- ALREADY FIXED (title
                                 bar dark_hc convention, theme_manager.py).
                                 Every hover, focus ring, selection, and
                                 progress fill in this file resolves to
                                 this one color.
     disabled-text    #7F7F7F   the one place a mid-gray is allowed --
                                 matches the real Windows HC "GrayText"
                                 system color

   No "danger" red exists in this variant on purpose: Windows High Contrast
   themes intentionally avoid leaning on hue to distinguish a destructive
   control from a normal one (a red-blind user would see no difference).
   #dangerButton instead gets a *structural* tell -- a yellow border by
   default that fully inverts (solid yellow fill, black text) on press,
   exactly like every other button's pressed state, so the affordance
   survives without relying on color alone.

   ICON -- checkmark is a black variant of the same original glyph used in
   cccp.qss/cccp_dark.qss (assets/icons/cccp/checkmark_hc.png -- same
   two-polygon shape, recolored solid black so it reads against the yellow
   checked fill instead of disappearing into it).

   CURSOR -- shares cccp.qss's arrow.png (assets/cursors/cccp/arrow.png,
   hotspot 4,3) unchanged. Its cream/red palette isn't the HC black/white/
   yellow contract, but a real system pointer isn't a themed UI control
   either -- Windows' own literal High Contrast Black mode still ships a
   colored (white/black) arrow, not one recolored to the accent yellow, so
   leaving this one pointer off the strict HC token contract matches that
   real-world precedent rather than breaking it. Both fill and outline sit
   far from pure black, so it stays legible on this file's #000000 canvas.

   FOCUS VS HOVER -- QLineEdit/QSpinBox/QAbstractSpinBox/QComboBox's
   :focus rule used to also set the 2px yellow border already set by
   :hover, so a focused-not-hovered field and a hovered-not-focused field
   showed the identical border with only a same-color outline ring as the
   sole tell. Trimmed :focus back to leaving the resting 1px white border
   alone and adding only the outline -- the same thin-contour-only pattern
   this file already used for QPushButton and QCheckBox -- so focus stays
   visibly distinct from hover without losing the keyboard-focus ring.

   The title bar is NOT drawn by this stylesheet -- see
   src/torrent2000/ui/widgets/app_title_bar.py and ui/theme/theme_manager.py
   (dark_hc forces every theme's caption to this same black/white/yellow
   contract).
   ===================================================================== */

* {
    font-family: "Arial", "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    font-size: 9pt;
}

QMainWindow, QWidget#centralWidget, QDialog {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    cursor: url(theme:cursors/cccp/arrow.png) 4 3;
}

QWidget {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------- Tabs */

QTabWidget::pane {
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    background-color: #000000;
    top: -1px;
}

QTabWidget#mainTabs::pane {
    border-top: none;
    top: 0px;
}

QTabBar::tab {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    border-bottom: none;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 5px 16px;
    margin-right: 1px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QTabBar::tab:hover:!selected {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
    color: #FFFF00;
    border-color: #FFFF00;
    border-width: 2px;
}

QTabBar::tab:selected {
    background-color: #000000;
    border-color: #FFFF00;
    border-bottom: 4px solid #000000;
    margin-top: 0px;
    color: #FFFF00;
}

QTabBar::tab:!selected {
    margin-top: 2px;
}

QTabBar::tab:disabled {
    color: #7F7F7F;
    border-color: #7F7F7F;
}

QTabBar::tab:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline-offset: -3px;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ GroupBox */

QGroupBox {
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    border-top: 4px solid #FFFF00;
    border-radius: 0px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    padding-top: 10px;
    background-color: #000000;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #FFFF00;
    cursor: url(theme:cursors/cccp/arrow.png) 4 3;
}

QTabBar {
    cursor: url(theme:cursors/cccp/arrow.png) 4 3;
}

QGroupBox::title {
    subcontrol-origin: margin;
    left: 10px;
    top: -2px;
    padding: 0 6px;
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #FFFF00;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------- Buttons */

QPushButton {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    min-height: 18px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QPushButton:hover:!pressed {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    color: #FFFF00;
}

QPushButton:pressed {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    color: #000000;
}

QPushButton:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

QPushButton:default {
    border-width: 2px;
    border-color: #FFFF00;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

QPushButton:disabled {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #7F7F7F;
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

/* No hue-only "danger" tell in HC -- see header comment. The structural
   difference is the yellow-by-default border (every other button starts
   white) plus the same full-invert-on-press every button gets. */
QPushButton#dangerButton {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 2px 10px;
    min-height: 16px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:hover:!pressed {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
    border: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:pressed {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    border: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
    color: #000000;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
    outline-offset: 2px;
}

QPushButton#dangerButton:disabled {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #7F7F7F;
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------- Text input */

QLineEdit, QSpinBox, QAbstractSpinBox {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    selection-background-color: #FFFF00;
    selection-color: #000000;
}

QLineEdit:hover, QSpinBox:hover, QAbstractSpinBox:hover {
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
}

QLineEdit:focus, QSpinBox:focus, QAbstractSpinBox:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QLineEdit:disabled, QSpinBox:disabled, QAbstractSpinBox:disabled {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #7F7F7F;
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-button, QAbstractSpinBox::down-button {
    subcontrol-origin: border;
    width: 16px;
    background-color: #000000;
    border-left: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-button {
    subcontrol-position: top right;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-button:hover, QAbstractSpinBox::down-button:hover {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::down-button {
    subcontrol-position: bottom right;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::down-arrow {
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-top: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QAbstractSpinBox::up-arrow:disabled, QAbstractSpinBox::down-arrow:disabled {
    border-bottom-color: #7F7F7F;
    border-top-color: #7F7F7F;
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------------- Combo */

QComboBox {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 2px 4px;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    selection-background-color: #FFFF00;
    selection-color: #000000;
}

QComboBox:hover {
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
}

QComboBox:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QComboBox:disabled {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #7F7F7F;
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

QComboBox::drop-down {
    subcontrol-origin: padding;
    subcontrol-position: right;
    width: 20px;
    background-color: #000000;
    border-left: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QComboBox::drop-down:hover {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
}

QComboBox::down-arrow {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    image: none;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
    border-right: 3px solid transparent;
    border-top: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QComboBox::down-arrow:disabled {
    border-top: 4px solid #7F7F7F;
}

/* Popup list -- see cccp.qss's header comment for why the highlight is
   declared on both QComboBox and the popup view. Text and fill are never
   the same color in any state below (black-on-yellow throughout). */
QComboBox QAbstractItemView {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline: none;
    padding: 2px;
    selection-background-color: #FFFF00;
    selection-color: #000000;
}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView::item {
    padding: 4px 8px;
    min-height: 20px;
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: none;
}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView::item:hover {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    color: #000000;
}

QComboBox QAbstractItemView::item:selected {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    color: #000000;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------ Checkbox */

QCheckBox {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    spacing: 6px;
}

QCheckBox:disabled {
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

QCheckBox::indicator {
    width: 13px;
    height: 13px;
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:hover {
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    border: 1px solid #FFFF00;
    image: url(theme:icons/cccp/checkmark_hc.png);
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked:hover {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:disabled {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #7F7F7F;
}

QCheckBox::indicator:checked:disabled {
    background-color: #7F7F7F;
    border: 1px solid #7F7F7F;
}

/* -------------------------------------------------------------- Slider */

QSlider::groove:horizontal {
    height: 4px;
    background-color: #7F7F7F;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
}

QSlider::groove:horizontal:disabled {
    background-color: #3F3F3F;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal {
    width: 14px;
    margin: -6px 0;
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    border: 2px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:pressed {
    background-color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:focus {
    outline: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    outline-offset: 1px;
}

QSlider::handle:horizontal:disabled {
    background-color: #7F7F7F;
    border: 1px solid #3F3F3F;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------- Tables and trees */

QTableWidget, QTreeWidget {
    background-color: #000000;
    alternate-background-color: #0D0D0D;
    gridline-color: #7F7F7F;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    selection-background-color: #FFFF00;
    selection-color: #000000;
    outline: none;
    cursor: url(theme:cursors/cccp/arrow.png) 4 3;
}

QTableWidget::item, QTreeWidget::item {
    padding: 2px;
}

QTableWidget::item:hover, QTreeWidget::item:hover {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
}

QTableWidget::item:selected, QTreeWidget::item:selected {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    color: #000000;
}

QHeaderView::section {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    padding: 3px 6px;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #FFFF00;
}

QHeaderView::section:hover {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border-color: #FFFF00;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------- ListBox */

QListWidget {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    outline: none;
}

QListWidget::item {
    padding: 4px 6px;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
}

QListWidget::item:hover {
    background-color: #1A1A00;
    border-left: 3px solid #FFFF00;
}

QListWidget::item:selected {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    color: #000000;
    border-left: 3px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QListWidget::item:selected:!active {
    background-color: #7F7F00;
    color: #000000;
}

/* ------------------------------------------------------------------ Menu */

QMenu {
    background-color: #000000;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    padding: 3px;
}

QMenu::item {
    background-color: transparent;
    padding: 5px 24px 5px 16px;
    border-left: 3px solid transparent;
}

QMenu::item:selected {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    color: #000000;
    border-left: 3px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QMenu::item:disabled {
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

QMenu::separator {
    height: 2px;
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    margin: 4px 8px;
}

QMenu::icon {
    padding-left: 6px;
}

/* --------------------------------------------------------- ProgressBar */

QProgressBar {
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
    background-color: #000000;
    text-align: center;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: bold;
}

QProgressBar::chunk {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    margin: 1px;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------- Misc chrome */

QLabel {
    background: transparent;
    color: #FFFFFF;
}

QLabel:disabled {
    color: #7F7F7F;
}

QSplitter::handle {
    background-color: #000000;
}

QSplitter::handle:hover {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
}

QScrollBar:vertical {
    background: #000000;
    width: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical {
    background-color: #7F7F7F;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    min-height: 24px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:vertical:hover {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-line:vertical {
    height: 0px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
}

QScrollBar::add-page:vertical, QScrollBar::sub-page:vertical {
    background: none;
}

QScrollBar:horizontal {
    background: #000000;
    height: 16px;
    border: 1px solid #FFFFFF;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal {
    background-color: #7F7F7F;
    border: 1px solid #000000;
    min-width: 24px;
}

QScrollBar::handle:horizontal:hover {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
}

QScrollBar::add-line:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-line:horizontal {
    width: 0px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
}

QScrollBar::add-page:horizontal, QScrollBar::sub-page:horizontal {
    background: none;
}

QSizeGrip {
    background-color: #000000;
    width: 16px;
    height: 16px;
}

QToolTip {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    border: 2px solid #FFFF00;
    border-radius: 0px;
    padding: 4px 6px;
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------------------
   Propaganda side panel (src/torrent2000/ui/widgets/propaganda_panel.py)
   --------------------------------------------------------------------- */

QWidget#cccpPropagandaPanel {
    background-color: #000000;
    border-left: 4px solid #FFFF00;
}

QLabel#propagandaHeader {
    color: #FFFF00;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 10pt;
}

QLabel#propagandaMessage {
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-size: 9pt;
}

QFrame#propagandaDivider {
    background-color: #FFFF00;
    border: none;
}
